      "license": "CC BY-SA 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0",
      "artist": "Tatiana Bulyonkova",
      "description": "Пожар в Юганском заповеднике, 27.07.2012\n\nA big patch of mostly coniferous forest burning in the Yuganskiy nature reserve. The tiny pale-green spot on the right is a small peatbog where the helicopter dropped us off. A day later the fire approached the bog, turning our little mycological journey into something a bit too extreme :)",
